      .md-content h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 700; color: #e8e8e8; margin: 0 0 16px; }
      .md-content h2 { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; color: #c77dff; margin: 28px 0 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #1e1e2e; padding-bottom: 6px; }
      .md-content h3 { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 600; color: #e8e8e8; margin: 20px 0 8px; }
      .md-content p { font-size: 0.875rem; color: #b0b0c8; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 12px; }
      .md-content ul, .md-content ol { font-size: 0.875rem; color: #b0b0c8; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 12px; padding-left: 20px; }
      .md-content li { margin-bottom: 3px; }
      .md-content strong { color: #e8e8e8; }
      .md-content code { font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.8rem; background: #0d0d1a; color: #c77dff; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; }
      .md-content pre { background: #0d0d1a; border: 1px solid #1e1e2e; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; overflow-x: auto; margin: 12px 0; }
      .md-content pre code { background: none; padding: 0; }
      .md-content table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.85rem; margin: 12px 0; }
      .md-content th { background: #0d0d1a; color: #c77dff; padding: 8px 12px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #1e1e2e; font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
      .md-content td { padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #1e1e2e; color: #b0b0c8; }
      .md-content tr:nth-child(even) td { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); }
      .md-content hr { border: none; border-top: 1px solid #1e1e2e; margin: 24px 0; }
      .md-content blockquote { border-left: 3px solid #9b5de5; padding-left: 12px; margin: 12px 0; color: #6a6a8a; }
    4:T14e8,<h1>Plugin &amp; Software Install Checklist</h1>
<p><strong>When installing anything audio-related, follow this guide so everything lands in the right place.</strong></p>
<hr>
<h2>Folder Reference</h2>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>What</th>
<th>Where it goes</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>Ableton projects (.als)</td>
<td><code>~/Music/ANIMAL/01_Production/Projects/</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Ableton templates</td>
<td><code>~/Music/ANIMAL/01_Production/Templates/</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Exported stems</td>
<td><code>~/Music/ANIMAL/01_Production/Stems/</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Work-in-progress bounces</td>
<td><code>~/Music/ANIMAL/01_Production/Bounces/</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Acapellas</td>
<td><code>~/Music/ANIMAL/01_Production/Acapellas/</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>All samples</td>
<td><code>~/Music/ANIMAL/08_Samples/</code> (organized by type)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Splice downloads</td>
<td><code>~/Music/ANIMAL/08_Samples/Splice/</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Serum presets</td>
<td><code>~/Music/ANIMAL/08_Samples/Serum-Presets/</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Rob Papen presets</td>
<td><code>~/Music/ANIMAL/08_Samples/Rob-Papen-Presets/</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>VST2 plugins</td>
<td><code>~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/VST/</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>VST3 plugins</td>
<td><code>~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/VST3/</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Audio Units (AU)</td>
<td><code>~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/Components/</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Ableton User Library</td>
<td><code>~/Music/Ableton/User Library/</code></td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<hr>
<h2>Known Plugins to Install</h2>
<h3>✅ Priority 1 — Install These First</h3>
<ul>
<li><p><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> <strong>Xfer Serum</strong> — download from xferrecords.com, run installer, AU/VST auto-installs</p>
<ul>
<li>After install: move presets to <code>~/Music/ANIMAL/08_Samples/Serum-Presets/</code></li>
<li>Point Serum&#39;s preset folder to that location inside the plugin</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><p><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> <strong>Rob Papen plugins</strong> — download from robpapen.com, run installers</p>
<ul>
<li>Likely includes: Blue-II, SubBoomBass, Predator, Punch, Blade — install all at once</li>
<li>After install: export/save presets to <code>~/Music/ANIMAL/08_Samples/Rob-Papen-Presets/</code></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><p><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> <strong>Splice</strong> — download app from splice.com</p>
<ul>
<li>In Splice settings: set download folder to <code>~/Music/ANIMAL/08_Samples/Splice/</code></li>
<li>This keeps all Splice samples in one organized place</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h3>✅ Loopmasters / Loopcloud</h3>
<ul>
<li><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Download Loopcloud app from loopcloud.com — installs desktop app + VST/AU plugin together</li>
<li><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> In Loopcloud settings: set local download folder to <code>~/Music/ANIMAL/08_Samples/Loopmasters/</code></li>
<li><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> After install: open Ableton → rescan plugins → Loopcloud plugin will appear in browser</li>
<li><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Add Loopcloud as a plugin on any track to browse + preview samples in-session at your tempo</li>
<li><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> Workflow: search sample in Loopcloud → preview in key → drag directly onto Ableton track</li>
</ul>
<h3>🔮 Recommended Additions (When Budget Allows)</h3>
<ul>
<li><p><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> <strong>Ableton Live Suite upgrade</strong> (~$250 upgrade from Standard)</p>
<ul>
<li>Unlocks Max for Live — needed for advanced live performance tools</li>
<li>Worth it for the live PA build</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><p><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> <strong>iZotope RX</strong> — industry standard for audio repair and vocal cleaning</p>
</li>
<li><p><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> <strong>FabFilter Pro-Q 3</strong> — best EQ plugin available, essential for mastering</p>
</li>
<li><p><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> <strong>Waves Gold bundle</strong> — if you have existing licenses, reauthorize these</p>
</li>
<li><p><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> <strong>Native Instruments Komplete</strong> — massive instrument library, great for production</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2>Ableton Setup Steps (Do This After Installing Plugins)</h2>
<ol>
<li><p>Open Ableton → Preferences → Plugins</p>
</li>
<li><p>Set VST2 folder: <code>~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/VST/</code></p>
</li>
<li><p>Set VST3 folder: <code>~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/VST3/</code></p>
</li>
<li><p>Enable AU plugins: check &quot;Use Audio Units&quot;</p>
</li>
<li><p>Click &quot;Rescan&quot; — Ableton will find everything</p>
</li>
<li><p>Preferences → Library</p>
</li>
<li><p>Set User Library to: <code>~/Music/Ableton/User Library/</code></p>
</li>
<li><p>In Ableton sidebar → Add folder → <code>~/Music/ANIMAL/08_Samples/</code></p>
<ul>
<li>This makes your entire sample library browsable from inside Ableton</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><p>In Splice app settings → Change download folder to <code>~/Music/ANIMAL/08_Samples/Splice/</code></p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr>
<h2>After Every New Install — Run This Check</h2>
<p>Tell PriScylla: &quot;scan for new plugins&quot; and I&#39;ll verify everything landed in the right place and is visible in Ableton.</p>
<hr>
<p><em>Created: March 14, 2026</em></p>
